{"ref":"BDB, חָנָן","hw":"חָנָן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָנָן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>gracious;</em> cf. Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">חנן</span>, Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">חנא</span><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  one of the warriors of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.43\">1 Ch 11:43</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  one of the heads of families of Nethinim <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:46\" href=\"/Ezra.2.46\">Ezr 2:46</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:48\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.48\">Ne 7:49</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  names of Levites <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.7\">Ne 8:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.11\">10:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.3\">13:3</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  chiefs of the people: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:23\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.23\">Ne 10:23</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:27\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.27\">Ne 10:27</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  Benjamite name <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.23\">1 Ch 8:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.38\">38</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:44\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.44\">9:44</a> (cf. n.pr.loc. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית חָנָן</span>, Mish. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּפַר חָנָן</span>).<br><strong>6.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ הָאֱלֹהִים</span> head of a prophetic guild, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי הָנָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.4\">Je 35:4</a>.","next":"BDB, חָנוּן","prev":"BDB, חַנָּה"}